  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Investment Exchange Partnership (Asia) 2020 - 2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s partnership with the Asia Impact Investment Exchange (IIX) responds to the needs of women and women entrepreneurs in marginalized communities across emerging markets (particularly in Southeast Asia) through innovative gender-lens blended financial products across multi-sector portfolios. The current activity - Scaling the Orange Bond Initiative (OBI) - seeks to create a recognised asset class for gender bonds to encourage the development of more and higher quality gender bonds that comply with a set of principles. The OBI will build the financial ecosystem and infrastructure to mobilise greater scale capital transactions, with a focus on investments with outcomes for both climate resilience and gender equality. The OBI takes an intersectional approach and has an increased focus on disability inclusion. Technical support, data analytics and impact measurement tools for investors and investees is an important element of the OBI.</narrative>
  </description>
